[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 307.59, "timestamp": "00:05:07", "text": "好的。我在這裡。我在這裡。大家好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 331.67, "timestamp": "00:05:31", "text": "我當時應該在場。呃，非常抱歉我來晚了。呃，因為我當時在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 336.07, "timestamp": "00:05:36", "text": "想，我到底該不該做這件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 339.35, "timestamp": "00:05:39", "text": "？我當時想，過了好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 342.31, "timestamp": "00:05:42", "text": "一會兒我才接受，然後我就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 345.189, "timestamp": "00:05:45", "text": "好吧，那我就這麼做吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 348.79, "timestamp": "00:05:48", "text": "最初，我計劃舉辦生日派對。  我原本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 350.95, "timestamp": "00:05:50", "text": "沒打算做生日倒數"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 355.27, "timestamp": "00:05:55", "text": "直播。其實我只是想跟"}]